---
 changes/02-bugfix/1650-safety-shift-bounds.md | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 changes/02-bugfix/1650-safety-shift-bounds.md

diff --git a/changes/02-bugfix/1650-safety-shift-bounds.md b/changes/02-bugfix/1650-safety-shift-bounds.md
